      "locked": false,
      "text": "- so now the QPS is more than 5k so we need multiple instances to manage bandwidth and throughput\n- to manage multiple server we need a LB to distribute the trafffic\n- a global counter to manage next short url count \n- then we can further optimize the system to scale read and write op separately",
